                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a60e0bba-77c0-329d-a5f6-803e685ad7c0",
                        "entry_id": "033dd2a7-397b-3c09-a965-71f8b6e61588",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cheburashka (a character in Soviet children's literature and the protagonist of an animated film), Topple (a former English translation)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "57d7651c-c514-4693-8592-bd111167f1ef",
                                "sense_id": "a60e0bba-77c0-329d-a5f6-803e685ad7c0",
                                "text": "Мои́ роди́тели утвержда́ли, что Чебура́шка – э́то неизве́стный нау́ке зверь, кото́рый во́дится в жа́рких тропи́ческих леса́х.",
                                "translation": "My parents claimed that Floptop was an animal unknown to science who lived in hot tropical forests.",
                                "english": "My parents claimed that Floptop was an animal unknown to science who lived in hot tropical forests."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8ed7775-7708-4382-8a3e-7e0da2112b0a",
                                "sense_id": "a60e0bba-77c0-329d-a5f6-803e685ad7c0",
                                "text": "Тепе́рь я - Чебура́шка,\nМне ка́ждая дворня́жка\nПри встре́че сра́зу ла́пу подаё́т!",
                                "translation": "Now I'm Cheburashka,\n[And] every mutt, upon meeting,\nGives me its paw at once.",
                                "english": "Now I'm Cheburashka,\n[And] every mutt, upon meeting,\nGives me its paw at once."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
